    "body": "It looks like both functions can fail, or they wouldn't be returning a `Result`. Please use something like this for both `unwrap`s:\r\n```rs\r\nlet token = match Token::with_current_process() {\r\n    Ok(token) => token,\r\n    Err(e) => {\r\n        log::warn!(\"Failed to get process token: {e:?}\");\r\n        return false;\r\n};\r\n```",
